+/*
+ * laurel 2401: the WCN3990 supplies, as icnss votes them (icnss_vreg_info + trinket DT config):
+ * L8A vdd-cx-mx 0.64 V, L16A vdd-1.8-xo, L17A vdd-1.3-rfa 1.304 V, L23A vdd-3.3-ch0 3.0 V; RPM
